{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"fcaa20905e646fef52638ee11406d121669ccd5d9c1cdf8154b5f6c31cc2988f","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2452},"chapter":{"number":79,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["求主解救國家"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["亞薩的詩。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"上帝啊，外邦人進入你的產業，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"污穢你的聖殿，使耶路撒冷變成荒堆，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把你僕人的屍首交與天空的飛鳥為食，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把你聖民的肉交與地上的野獸，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在耶路撒冷周圍流他們的血如水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人葬埋。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們成為鄰國的羞辱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成為我們四圍人的嗤笑譏刺。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"耶和華啊，這到幾時呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要動怒到永遠嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的憤恨要如火焚燒嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願你將你的忿怒倒在那不認識你的外邦","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和那不求告你名的國度。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們吞了雅各，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把他的住處變為荒場。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"求你不要記念我們先祖的罪孽，向我們追討；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願你的慈悲快迎着我們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我們落到極卑微的地步。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拯救我們的上帝啊，求你因你名的榮耀幫助我們！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為你名的緣故搭救我們，赦免我們的罪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為何容外邦人說「他們的上帝在哪裏」呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願你使外邦人知道你在我們眼前","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"伸你僕人流血的冤。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"願被囚之人的歎息達到你面前；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願你按你的大能力存留那些將要死的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，願你將我們鄰邦所羞辱你的羞辱","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"加七倍歸到他們身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這樣，你的民，你草場的羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要稱謝你，直到永遠；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要述說讚美你的話，直到萬代。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/79.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/80.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/PSA/78.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}